{"title": "Possessed (status group)", "pageid": 34964, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Possessed_(status_group)", "categories": ["Status groups"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/45px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><b>SG_Possessed</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Status_group\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status group\">status group</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Immunity\"> Immunity </span></h2>\n<p>The following spells/actions grant immunity to all conditions in this status group:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/45px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/60px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Evil and Good\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\">Protection from Evil and Good</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"List_of_conditions_in_SG_Possessed\">List of conditions in SG_Possessed</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Hag's_Pawn\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hag's Pawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\">Hag's Pawn</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Ethel has taken control. Condition lasts until mask is removed or spellcaster is dead.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Incubus_Charmed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incubus_Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Incubus Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incubus Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Incubus_Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Incubus Charmed (Condition)\">Incubus Charmed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>You are charmed by a devil and must support it in battle. You can make another <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against this effect after taking damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Malefic_Possession\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malefic Possession\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Confused_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Malefic_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Malefic Possession (Condition)\">Malefic Possession</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The affected entity acts according to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Possession\" title=\"Possession\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Possessing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Possession\" title=\"Possession\">Possessing</a> ghost's will and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">4d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage each turn until it dies or is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Turned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Turned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Turned_(Condition)\" title=\"Turned (Condition)\">Turned</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Shadow_Possession\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Possession (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Possession\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Possession_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Possession (Condition)\">Shadow Possession</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is possessed by frenzied shadows and will attack the nearest creature. Its weapon attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202439\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1416/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21831/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4195/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 835368/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--